note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note tools/dagsim/dagsim.om -- Pure seeded OM-2 offline resource-DAG cost evaluator (omega-mv#583).
note Composes dag_parse, dag_res, dag_eval, dag_diff, dag_fmt, dag_jstr, pure OM-2 rx_costmodel, and ds_* runtime.
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Header 0..39 follows HANDOFF-DagsimOm; 40..63 reserved.
note Resources 64/12, ops 448/26, deps 7104/2, buffers 9152/8, removed 11200/8.
note Resource id pair kind slots cap lo hi prov src pair.
note Op id pair kind engine t lo hi prov has_t bytes bw launch launcher M N core arm src pair.
note Buffer id pair bytes cap first last. Removed op pair reason ref pair proof pair.
note Scratch starts 14000. KV 14100/5 (24); positional 14220/2 (8).
note Source pairs are truncated spans, never pointers. UINT32_MAX encodes negative indices.
